### 1 — Language Switching (Issue #1)

**Root Cause:** The `LanguageSwitcher` correctly calls `setLocale()` which updates `localStorage` and context. However, **the page text never re-renders** because the rest of the app uses hardcoded French strings — none of the page components call `useI18n().t()`. The i18n system is built but unused in page content. Additionally, the Settings `LanguageModal` calls `onLanguageChange()` which only calls `updateProfile()` (API call to save to DB), but **never calls `setLocale()`** on the i18n context, so the header switcher and the page language never change.

**Fix:**

#### [MODIFY] [LanguageModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/AYMANE%20MAALI/OneDrive/Bureau/houman-versel/components/settings/LanguageModal.tsx)
- Import and call `useI18n().setLocale()` when a language is selected, in addition to the existing `onLanguageChange` callback.
