- Change `regions` from `'us'` to `'eu,uk,us'` (covers more soccer bookmakers).
- Change `markets` from `'h2h,spreads,totals'` to `'h2h'` (cheaper quota cost, more universal).
- Add `commenceTimeFrom` and `commenceTimeTo` filters for upcoming matches (next 7 days).

#### [MODIFY] [lib/odds-api-transform.ts](file:///c:/Users/AYMANE%20MAALI/OneDrive/Bureau/houman-versel/lib/odds-api-transform.ts)
- In `getMatchStatus()`, extend the "live" window to 5 hours (covers NFL games), and add sport-specific duration overrides for soccer (2.5h), basketball (3h), etc.

#### [MODIFY] [app/sports/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/AYMANE%20MAALI/OneDrive/Bureau/houman-versel/app/sports/page.tsx)
