### Bonus #2 — Weekly Cashback (Casino + Sportsbook)

**"Up to 10% Weekly Cashback"**

#### Business Rules
| Rule | Value |
|---|---|
| Rate | 10% of net real-money losses |
| Calculation base | Deposits − withdrawals − remaining real-money balance (for the week) |
| Bonus-fund losses | **Excluded** — real money only |
| Paid as | Bonus funds (not cash) |
| Wagering requirement | 5× |
| Weekly cap | $150 max payout |
| Credit schedule | Auto-credited Monday 00:00 UTC |
| Expiry | 72 hours after credit |
| Estimated cost | ≈ 0.5–1.5% of weekly net losses |

#### Calculation Logic

```
net_loss = SUM(real_money_bets_lost) - SUM(real_money_wins)
           [real bets only; bonus-funded rounds excluded]
cashback_amount = MIN(net_loss × 0.10, 150.00)
cashback_amount = MAX(cashback_amount, 0.00)  // no cashback if profitable
```

#### Implementation

#### [NEW] `lib/cashback.ts`
- `calculateWeeklyCashback(userId, weekStart, weekEnd)` — queries `bets` and `casino_sessions` for real-money activity, returns cashback amount.
- `creditWeeklyCashback(userId)` — inserts into `user_bonuses` with type `'cashback'`, 5× wagering, 72h expiry.

#### [NEW] Cron Job / Scheduled Route `app/api/cron/weekly-cashback/route.ts`
- Protected endpoint called by a cron trigger every Monday 00:00 UTC.
- Iterates all eligible users (had real-money activity in the past 7 days).
- Calls `calculateWeeklyCashback()` → if > $0, calls `creditWeeklyCashback()`.
- Sends an in-app notification (calls existing `lib/notifications.ts`).

#### [MODIFY] `app/api/bets/` routes
- Tag each settled bet with `funded_by: 'real' | 'bonus'` so cashback calculation can exclude bonus-funded losses.

